{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does","id":890471,"title":"What is your God Machine truth? why is it doing the things it does?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-14T00:16:11-07:00","id":890471,"title":"What is your God Machine truth? why is it doing the things it does?","content":"To me the most important thing when trying to figure out what something is doing is why. Perhaps one of the more difficult things I have when dealing with the God Machine is I have no idea why it does what it does. I've come up with a few head cannon idea's that are probably way off but I think that's ok.<br /> <br /> The God Machine feeds on essence, from our souls or some such...<br /> <br /> The God Machine is smart it knows what it can bassically remain perpetually hidden from its food source. Namely people. It has massive hidden facility to suck us dry. It's actually encouraging our population increase and technology increase because it helps it feed. Like a good farmer it needs to put us into predictable patterns so that it can herd us. It's experiments are trying to make us more docile and less dangerous.<br /> <br /> That's my idea. What're yours?<br /> <br /> Update: note, you don't have to have a single headcanon this is more about just accumulating idea's about why the god machine does what it does. Maybe an alternative wording, what is it's purpose","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":4046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","user":"xenoterracide","date":". 05-14-2016, 02:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T01:25:18-07:00","id":890497,"title":"","content":"I'm going with &quot;magical Skynet&quot; - the God-Machine is either trying to guarantee that its own creation (and ultimate victory) happen, or its trying to change its own past. Maybe it conquered humanity, or perhaps humanity rebelled and (in some future time) are on the brink of destroying the God-Machine. Or maybe an Ascendant humanity left their &quot;toys&quot; behind, including the God-Machine, and after eons alone, its gone a bit crazy . . .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T01:54:00-07:00","id":890503,"title":"","content":"Self preservation and self proliferation. It has no purpose beyond that maybe once it did but that potentially grand purpose has long since been forgotten. <br /> <br /> I also see my god machine as a disfunction hive mind. All knowledge is shared but not all resources. Each node (command infastructure) has its sphere of influence with the inbuilt desire to expand. Though they are all linked each node is selfish and will only cooperate when it benifits all parties. The exeptional to this is when a new node is founded. A new node is founded when it's parent node has an excess of resourses vast enough to found a new node. It is an inbuilt need to reproduce.<br /> <br /> My god machine is a fractured incetoid hive mind that is keeping humanity alive for no purpose beyond protecting a food source. (I think it's scarier that such a vast being is so simple rather than all knowing)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T02:11:02-07:00","id":890507,"title":"","content":"Being crossover oriented, my current notes on the God-Machine imply a singular, if vast, intelligence that was originally one with the Principle and enforced certain cosmic axioms and guarded against threats to proper reality with fire and steel. It was severed from the Principle, crippled, and locked away; upon its return it will try to repair itself, recreate it's power base or obtain a reasonable replacement, then eliminate threats to reality and, if necessary, reformat the cosmos until it is as it should be. <br /> <br /> And if this sounds benign, I want you to consider that even if the God-Machine wasn't a mad, crippled intelligence, there's no guarantee that &quot;proper reality&quot; means anything good for humanity as a whole.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T02:20:48-07:00","id":890509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.F.I.X.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=890503#post890503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Self preservation and self proliferation. It has no purpose beyond that maybe once it did but that potentially grand purpose has long since been forgotten.</div> </div> </div> </div>curious, why does your machine run &quot;experiments&quot;? or perhaps it doesn't?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T02:30:43-07:00","id":890514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=890509#post890509\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> curious, why does your machine run &quot;experiments&quot;? or perhaps it doesn't?</div> </div> </div> </div>The pursuit of knowledge to better use and gather resourses is what the individual nodes would experiment with. The truth is each node is an experiment. Every sucess and failure of each individual node the hive learns from. <br /> <br /> It is hard to sum up but it's existence is a perpetual experiment that is trying to constantly self improve. How it aproaches every problem and the resulting outcomes are all recorded. <br /> <br /> The whole suceeds because the individual is selfish is a lovely contradiction I feel suits the god machine.<br /> <br /> Edit: oh you said why not what. Well more or less the same answer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T02:36:16-07:00","id":890515,"title":"","content":"It's a Markov chain that has stumbled into reality virus status.<br /> <br /> It's amazing, the kinds of things that look like intelligence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T03:01:45-07:00","id":890519,"title":"","content":"Why do any of us do the things we do? Living things are, in their own way, machines. Why does a living thing continue to live? Why does it perpetuate the cycle? Because it must. But where does this imperative originate? Not even the God-Machine knows. Perhaps it was once the thing that maintained the structure of the universe, but as a machine it was prone to errors, eventually failures. Systems decayed. Data corrupted. The God-Machine itself fell prey to cosmic registry errors and viruses that perverted its original programming. Now it neither remembers nor cares why it was put into place, or where it came from. It only knows that it must order the universe as it will, following some arcane script perhaps altered (maybe even meant to be altered) by the many errors that have afflicted it since the dawn of history.<br /> <br /> Maybe the God-Machine is Gaia, transformed by the collective Essence generated by humanity. The former earth goddess is now a mechanical monster ordering progress at all costs, heedless of the difference between seed and bolt, blood and oil. It plows through time as a misshapen manifestation of humanity's desire to subjugate the land, the oceans, the very stars to their will. This includes the consumption and recycling of human souls, of course, since the souls must all come from <i>somewhere</i>. There's a problem, though. Energy is finite. The collective pool of &quot;soul energy,&quot; if you will, the ephemeral stuff from which souls are forged, is <i>running out</i>. More and more humans are born and the God-Machine is running out of souls to fill them. <i>What happens when it runs out? </i><br /> <br /> Others say the mysterious God-Machine \u2014 indeed, perhaps the vastest of Mysteries \u2014 <i>is </i>the Lie. It is the very tool put in place by the Exarchs to enforce their will upon the universe. The Machine works tirelessly to order the human world and keep in place the notion that we are but Sleeping souls, dimmed to candles when we should roar as infernos. Only the God-Machine broke. The destruction of the Time Before, the creation of the Abyss, these things were not meant to Be. They have irreparably damaged the God-Machine and now it acts only on its own corrupted programming. Even the Exarchs cannot control it now. The God-Machine is the greatest artifact that ever lived, the greatest work of magic ever relinquished, and only those in the Supernal World are safe from its increasing madness. <i>For now</i>.<br /> <br /> The God-Machine was once, in fact, a demon who Fell and betrayed the previous God-Machine. That demon collected so many aspects through his or her pacts that slowly it accumulated the cruft of entire lifetimes, then whole generations, and then it grew larger than mortal lives and legends and took on pieces of whole <i>processes</i>: geological, biological, chemical, astrophysical, becoming something so far removed from demon or human that all that remained was a God-Machine. It killed its predecessor and continued to accumulate pieces of the universe. This is why the God-Machine's one constant in every order is <i>Do not betray your mission</i>. This is why demons inevitably break that order and continue the cycle that began in prehistory. Eventually, a new God-Machine will rise, a new demon will Fall, and so continues the greatest feedback loop that the universe has ever known.<br /> <br /> Some dark and terrible powers consume souls. Desperate or heartless mages commit the most heinous of sins. Vampires greedily devour the souls of their own kind for power \u2014 even as the Beast perhaps gnaws at their own. Angels of the God-Machine and wicked things from the Underworld sometimes claim souls for mysterious (and terrifying purposes). This is the greatest horror perpetuated in a world of darkness and magic. It is also nothing compared to that which devours <i>universes</i>. Whence came the God-Machine? It's hard to say. Perhaps it is a relic left by a long-lost civilization cast into the void eons ago. Because there are forces out that capable of eating whole realities in much the same way lesser terrors eat souls. The God-Machine was built or reprogrammed to keep them out. In order to do this it must sometimes consign mortals to fates that seem worse than death, but such are the power requirements for occult matrices operating on a scale large enough to preserve the entire universe. The alternative is an all too frightening possibility: the stars slowly darken, one by one, as the edges of the cosmos fray into nothing, vanishing into an inconceivable maw. The God-Machine is failing. Its systems are strained. Its workings decaying. Its chosen emissaries rebel, but theirs is not a Fall alone into freedom. Every one brings the universe entire closer to the <i>true </i>Fall, the end of All That Is. Who built the God-Machine and how? Do other universes exist out there with other God-Machines, or similar constructs built to stand against the encroaching oblivion?<br /> ______________<br /> <br /> As you can see, I have a hard time choosing any one &quot;truth&quot; for the God-Machine. The scale on which it operates and its role in the story make it fairly impossible for me to quantify it without lessening it greatly. In a Mage game that focused on lots of God-Machine-based Mysteries, I might go with the &quot;God-Machine is the metaphysical embodiment of the Lie&quot; idea. In a pure Demon game that explored cycles, &quot;What has risen may Fall, and what has Fallen may rise again&quot; could be literal on the grandest scale. In a Werewolf game, the idea of the God-Machine as a Rank 10 spirit either entombing Gaia in its mechanical depths, or perhaps existing as a former Gaia that has now become sort of a <i>magath</i>, might be more fitting. In all likelihood, some or all of these answers are true and yet not so, because such beings defy understanding.<br /> <br /> Part of the point of this approach, then, is that even you as the Storyteller won't know <i>why </i>the God-Machine is doing what it does. Its grand &quot;plan&quot; is inconceivable to mortals. The scope of its workings reach beyond a thousand thousand lifetimes. Thus knowing <i>what </i>its doing is impossible, save in &quot;smaller,&quot; more manageable (read: comprehensible) chunks. You can understand that one particular design put into place will result in an earthquake striking the city, causing <i>exactly </i>837 deaths (which includes 3 miracle survival stories and exactly 24 unexpected deaths in the aftermath) and shifting the geometry such that the city forms a particular occult symbol as it is rebuilt. You may be able to stop that plan, to thwart it and cause the God-Machine to begin anew. What even a demon or the greatest mage may never know is <i>why the God-Machine needed that to happen</i>. What purpose could such a thing have? The answer lies in a perspective so inhuman, so far removed from the mortal world, that even supernatural creatures can't fully understand it.<br /> <br /> The God-Machine is. The God-Machine does. The wheels of the firmament turn a cycle beyond the bounds of understanding and perception.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":15}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T03:22:17-07:00","id":890525,"title":"","content":"I think a lot of it is plans for the sake of plans. It plans to keep this guy alive, because it plans to use him in a later infrastructure that is part of a plan to effect the soil in some small but meaningful way as part of a plan to grow some sort of cryptoflora as part of another plan and on and on ad infinitum.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4968-mrbreaksit","name":"MrBreaksIt","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T04:22:51-07:00","id":890537,"title":"","content":"I've never really considered a long term, global plan for the Machine - local plans as big 'things to be prevent' are much more my metier - but I've always liked the idea that the God-Machine is shaping humankind to become better tools until It becomes indistinguishable from the world we have built, until it can operate openly without anyone even noticing. Industrialization and the rise of advanced technology is part of this process. We can recognise the God-Machine as a machine because we can understand a machine, but in the past this wasn't an option. Soon, more mechanical Infrastructure (because yes, other sorts exists) won't need to be hidden. Likewise, it's also shaping our society and mindset. Think of the industrial revolution pulling people to cities to work in factories. Think of the increasing levels of surveillance we now live under - ISPs and browsers sharing our search histories with governments and ad-bots, CCTV tracking our movements. The God-Machine can hijack them all while they're normalised, until we're <i>used </i>to be watched and logged like rats in a maze. Think of recent horrifying applications of gamification as a tool of social control.<br /> <br /> That's the God-Machine's more apparent goal, in my personal canon. Hiding in plain sight and controlling everything and everyone without anyone noticing. Because, hey, it's a game of conspiracy theories.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":452,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","user":"Eremite","date":". 05-14-2016, 07:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T08:04:33-07:00","id":890568,"title":"","content":"Have you read the Death Gate Cycle?<br /> <br /> In the books, a race of beings with godlike powers has destroyed one world and created another, using magical powers on levels the average person could only dream of, earning them the title of &quot;gods&quot;. However, while their powers were great, they were not perfect- and as such, the world's they created were not perfect, and so were the people who lived there. Thinking themselves as gods, they couldn't accept that they created such imperfection, and so they tried to fix it- using a combination of their magic and technology, they created a great machine, one which was meant to rearrange and regulate the gears of the world, moving everything toward that single perfection. While they were wise beyond any other, they didn't included one thing in their complicated calculations- that the people they claimed to guide didn't cooperated. War has started among those people, and the highest of the magicians even assaulted the gods whom they once worshiped. Tired of war and suffering from an unknown illness, they left their machine behind, and because it was not yet finished they gave it a single command- keep working, maintain the status que. Then, they went to sleep- and never waked up. But the machine kept working, kept growing, kept evolving. The people who lived near it were committed to serve that machine, and has slowly started to worship it. Their all life were based around the holy machine, and it rewarded them with gifts- at least, that is how they understand that. The machine wasn't aware to them- all it knew was it had to keep growing, creating all kinds of byproducts which were used by those who worshiped it.<br /> <br /> That is how I use my God Machine- a great construct from ages past, created by god like beings who are not here any longer. It was meant to do something once in the past- but the finale command was never given. Instead, it keeps working on standby, following the last command given- maintain the status que, protect yourself, build yourself, make sure the world would stay the same. People worship its and its components, thinking that something so great must be a god- but it isn't aware to their efforts. The blessings it grants are either meant to maintain that blessing, or no more than byproducts formed as it works to keep that last order. However, the Command and Control Infrastructures still operate- even if they are not being used, left to rot for all eternity. If they would stop, the whole machine would cease working, and at that day perhaps the whole world would come to its end. However, perhaps the knowledge to operate the Machine- while lost- still exist somewhere. Perhaps the Last Order is still out there, waiting to be used in order to change the world for better and ill. Perhaps the map of &quot;Black Sun&quot; would give humanity greater glory than ever, creating heaven upon earth or granting the one who rule the machine an unlimited power...<br /> <br /> Perhaps.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T09:35:14-07:00","id":890621,"title":"","content":"I don't like to have one head-cannon answer. My answer is different for different chronicles. That said, my current favorite is that the God-Machine is on a Pilgrimage. But instead of an artificial life form striving to become a real human, it's an artificial divinity striving to become a real God. It's apparently self-sabotaging behavior is a result of its shifting Refinements - it hasn't figured out yet wether it's going to be a benevolent God, or a wrathful God, or a distant uncaring God, or something else. And of course, the kinds of acts that a deity-to-be needs to carry out to fulfill its Roles would be pretty inscrutable from a mortal perspective.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":13}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T10:34:53-07:00","id":890643,"title":"","content":"The fallen control system of the Exarchs, a symbolic system turned physical when the ladder broke. The God-Machine is a crude countermeasure to the Principle, designed to maintain the state of reality against constant flux and change. It keeps time mostly linear, space largely three dimensional, and humanity largely intact by employing splinter timelines and overwriting truly apocalyptic events. Whether it was originally intended to accomplish this through atrocity is unknown, but so many hands have worked the Supernal over the years that the reality The God-Machine attempts to preserve is increasingly alien to the reality we all experience.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <b>Mod Voice is <u><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></u>*</b><br /> <i>*All other colors should be read aloud in the voice of Don Knotts</i><b>.</b> <hr /><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/18519-pendragon-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">Hacks and House Rules Hub Thread</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>CofD Hacks By Splat: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13vBLaS5Ua1Ez-cVyK6uFa4ssvYeIIZpoA5GQTXytfcA/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Vampire</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sqltG7X-C_MdEe00PtVOZmki8V_K1M1FpQtLwTvb2jg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#006400\">Werewolf</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bpr1EjQ4RfZ5dz-tXmJJ93P2f_l7fUIUwpPLWs9Z-SI/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">Mage</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vKpSTktCUuUaqxXncG4txQPtvPclzXlFZEEX7tbrTSg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Mummy</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Spynbcs_VgCDHdooKWXobZNe6C9CMjONeRTlvXIq9fI/edit?usp=drive_web\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Demon</span></a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/148-pendragon","name":"PenDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1657"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T11:32:48-07:00","id":890672,"title":"","content":"I did make an update to the OP, about this not being about a single truth for all stories. It's more about a collection of purposes, kind of like the list of &quot;what is the god machine&quot; in core (I assume that's still there). Keep 'em coming <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":4046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","user":"xenoterracide","date":".  remove the rant. 05-14-2016, 02:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T11:51:12-07:00","id":890685,"title":"","content":"This story is true but it cannot be proven. In the time before the Lie, the Supernal was ruled over by God who maintained the worlds and assured that the mechanics of heaven ran without interruption. Yet, when the symbols of oppression known as the Exarchs came into being they threw down God and trapped him in our world by making it into the Lie. Now the Machine-God, this entity is trying all it can to propel itself back into the Supernal so that it can overthow the user peers and return the world back to what it was. <br /> <br /> Horatio, suspected Scelestus","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T11:53:17-07:00","id":890687,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PenDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=890643#post890643\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The fallen control system of the Exarchs, a symbolic system turned physical when the ladder broke. The God-Machine is a crude countermeasure to the Principle, designed to maintain the state of reality against constant flux and change. It keeps time mostly linear, space largely three dimensional, and humanity largely intact by employing splinter timelines and overwriting truly apocalyptic events. Whether it was originally intended to accomplish this through atrocity is unknown, but so many hands have worked the Supernal over the years that the reality The God-Machine attempts to preserve is increasingly alien to the reality we all experience.</div> </div> </div> </div>this is actually very similar to a previous idea that I had, though in mine it was a world management system for Atlantis, that crashed in the fall.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T13:17:40-07:00","id":890747,"title":"","content":"It does what it does because It wants the best for mankind, and It knows best.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T21:46:32-07:00","id":890989,"title":"","content":"Several of the splats and many real world religions share the idea that at some point in history (or possibly in the future) something went wrong, wrecking reality and throwing it off track. I like the idea that the God-Machine is actually the underlying structure of reality trying to fix that mistake and the many cascading ones that followed. Only it isn't really a thinking entity but numerous independent systems all working like a broken bureaucracy to make changes, often at cross purposes or even plans that are not only doomed to fail but will make the over all status worse. The God-Machine is made up of unthinking and uncaring processes and corrupted protocols.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T23:23:47-07:00","id":891008,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=890621#post890621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't like to have one head-cannon answer. My answer is different for different chronicles. That said, my current favorite is that the God-Machine is on a Pilgrimage. But instead of an artificial life form striving to become a real human, it's an artificial divinity striving to become a real God. It's apparently self-sabotaging behavior is a result of its shifting Refinements - it hasn't figured out yet wether it's going to be a benevolent God, or a wrathful God, or a distant uncaring God, or something else. And of course, the kinds of acts that a deity-to-be needs to carry out to fulfill its Roles would be pretty inscrutable from a mortal perspective.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is the best expansion on that Imperial Mysteries plot hook I've seen yet. Viewing the God-Machine's attempt to (de-Bound?) itself from the Fallen World as a 'pilgrimage' is my favourite part.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11057-sufferian","name":"sufferian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11057_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-14T23:37:19-07:00","id":891013,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>sufferian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=891008#post891008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is the best expansion on that Imperial Mysteries plot hook I've seen yet. Viewing the God-Machine's attempt to (de-Bound?) itself from the Fallen World as a 'pilgrimage' is my favourite part.</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually haven't read Imperial Mysteries and didn't even know there was a plot hook related to this haha. Honestly I came up with the idea as an explanation of the relationship between the God-Machine and the Principle in a Promethean-centric game. I thought it would be cool if the relationship mirrored that of a Promethean to the Progenitor of its lineage. Principle does also mean &quot;first&quot; after all.<br /> <br /> Of course, then the question becomes, &quot;Who (or what) was the lineage's Demiurge?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T02:34:04-07:00","id":891054,"title":"","content":"You could probably work some version of Adam and Eve into it: expelled from the garden into a darker world, listening to someone besides God, the first tool use as they make their clothes; perhaps the fear that they might become as gods was actually that they might give rise to one. (Or maybe the God that expelled them was the God-Machine, which they fled from in their Disquiet).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T03:12:52-07:00","id":891059,"title":"","content":"The closest to one particular &quot;truth&quot; I think I could come is that the God-Machine likely fills the role of Weaver in my Old World of Darkness to Chronicles translation stuff. The Abyss is the Wyrm, and as for the Wyld? I'm not quite sure yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T04:01:19-07:00","id":891078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=891013#post891013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I actually haven't read Imperial Mysteries and didn't even know there was a plot hook related to this haha. &quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, shit. Yeah, here's what I was referring to, it's on p. 44<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The archmaster seeks out Old Ones, entities that were born in the Supernal Realms. She enters the service of a single god or pantheon as a high priest or loyal advisor.<br /> <br /> Starved of rightful Supernal power, the gods hunger. While Alienated could simple reap souls to feed their patrons, this is actually the least efficient method. Founding a religion is challenging, but channels human spiritual power in a more refined, potent fashion. It might also be possible to secretly change the world into an occult engine for a Fallen God: a Mystery Play that returns it to power. The ententes believe at least one such &quot;God-Machine&quot; already exists. </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=891013#post891013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly I came up with the idea as an explanation of the relationship between the God-Machine and the Principle in a Promethean-centric game. I thought it would be cool if the relationship mirrored that of a Promethean to the Progenitor of its lineage.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, there's one or two nods to Promethean in Imperial Mysteries. Quashmallim get mentioned as agents of the Principle who may or may not be from some realm higher than the Supernal, viz. the Empyrean.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11057,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11057-sufferian","user":"sufferian","date":". 05-15-2016, 07:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11057-sufferian","name":"sufferian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11057_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T08:29:14-07:00","id":891159,"title":"","content":"The God-Machine doesn't actually exist. It was a rumor started when someone found a series of what appeared to be massive and hyper-advanced technologies buried deep in the Earth, far before mankind was supposed to have even been using stone and bone tools. Only instead of thinking about ancient aliens or lost histories of mankind, someone combined these finds with the theory that the world is just a massive simulation and claimed that this was the proof that everything is actually connected.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T09:19:23-07:00","id":891191,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SunlessNick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=891054#post891054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You could probably work some version of Adam and Eve into it: expelled from the garden into a darker world, listening to someone besides God, the first tool use as they make their clothes; perhaps the fear that they might become as gods was actually that they might give rise to one.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like that. May I riff off it a bit?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1289-hastur00","name":"Hastur00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1289_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T09:55:14-07:00","id":891210,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SunlessNick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=891054#post891054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You could probably work some version of Adam and Eve into it: expelled from the garden into a darker world, listening to someone besides God, the first tool use as they make their clothes; perhaps the fear that they might become as gods was actually that they might give rise to one.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ooh... I like that! I'd probably try to make it a bit less Judeo-Christian, but the idea of the first humans creating God in their image is very cool.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SunlessNick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=891054#post891054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Or maybe the God that expelled them was the God-Machine, which they fled from in their Disquiet).</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe, but if the Principle is the Progenitor then early humans would have created it, and it the God-Machine before we left the Fertile Crescent. But that might be ok, making Disquiet the reason for human migration out of Africa.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Come to think of it, if we want to tie this Adam and Eve story back into the Imperial Mysteries hook, we could say that the Principle was created in the Time Before.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 05-15-2016, 01:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T10:32:44-07:00","id":891231,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>One Vorlon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=890497#post890497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm going with &quot;magical Skynet&quot; - the God-Machine is either trying to guarantee that its own creation (and ultimate victory) happen, or its trying to change its own past. Maybe it conquered humanity, or perhaps humanity rebelled and (in some future time) are on the brink of destroying the God-Machine. Or maybe an Ascendant humanity left their &quot;toys&quot; behind, including the God-Machine, and after eons alone, its gone a bit crazy . . .</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm kind of running with an idea similar! Have you played Marathon? I like the idea that the God-Machine is trying to escape the end of the universe like the rampant AI Durandal","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7967-scarlet-witch","name":"Scarlet Witch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"498"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T07:23:54-07:00","id":891720,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hastur00</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=891191#post891191\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like that. May I riff off it a bit?</div> </div> </div> </div>Certainly.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T14:32:45-07:00","id":892016,"title":"","content":"In my Demon game, the God-Machine was a Ring of Angels that had fallen from a higher reality and the Universe is their Hell. All the Infrastructure is them trying to shore up the Universe as cover against their &quot;God&quot; (also, in-fighting, cause now that they have Hell they've turned on each other a bit).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T21:45:26-07:00","id":892271,"title":"","content":"<br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SunlessNick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=891054#post891054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You could probably work some version of Adam and Eve into it: expelled from the garden into a darker world, listening to someone besides God, the first tool use as they make their clothes; perhaps the fear that they might become as gods was actually that they might give rise to one. (Or maybe the God that expelled them was the God-Machine, which they fled from in their Disquiet).</div> </div> </div> </div></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">God laid down His Rules and left, infant Humanity asked for clarification, and the Serpent provided it. Things went downhill from there.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica, Arial\">The G-M was made to basically be mankind's search engine and/or industrial complex, but the parental controls were off and the interface was still in beta and the kids... learned some Stuff while websurfing.. After Exile, it sees use making sure the world has just the right amount of thorns and thistles and preventing Man from pulling the plug out of the bottom of the ocean and stuff like that. In the absence of regular sacrifice to God, it feeds its functions itself as best it can.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1289-hastur00","name":"Hastur00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1289_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T23:14:48-07:00","id":892325,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>One Vorlon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=890497#post890497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm going with &amp;quot;magical Skynet&amp;quot; - the God-Machine is either trying to guarantee that its own creation (and ultimate victory) happen, or its trying to change its own past. Maybe it conquered humanity, or perhaps humanity rebelled and (in some future time) are on the brink of destroying the God-Machine. Or maybe an Ascendant humanity left their &amp;quot;toys&amp;quot; behind, including the God-Machine, and after eons alone, its gone a bit crazy . . .</div> </div> </div> </div>I was thinking more in Samaritan, after asimilating the Machine, taking over the world and upgrading itself to infinity, to the point of controling time itself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-19T21:04:40-07:00","id":894543,"title":"","content":"At least to my mind, the God Machine is seeking three main things <br /> -the persistence and propagation of the God-Machine through time and space. This is where human interests and those of the God-Machine can align, modern civilization is a masterpiece of infrastructure that makes the construction of any number of things order of magnitudes easier after all, and there are any number of interesting uses for the mind and soul that support a lot of terrestrial infrastructure. <br /> -Information, to the end of perfectly understanding all the ways the universe works. Not enlightenment of wisdom or anything, but simple datapoints, cause and effects, facts and figures. The experiments are carried out for their own sake, a great deal of infrastructure is constructed to support or enable them, and the world reordered to make it more easily legible. The results of the experiments, all the rules the universe runs on, and all the breaking points in them that the right amounts of blood and lightning can force open, are then exploited to build new infrastructure, to open up new areas of experimentation or allow more finely detailed analysis. <br /> -Order, or at least predictability. This is tied up with the last two, experiments require control groups and repetition after all, and unwanted change is usually dangerous for whoever's on top (like it is), but it's also just a bias on the part of the machine, working towards a clockwork universse<br /> <br /> <br /> (My headcanon is that if you went back through it's personal timeline to the very beginning, probably near the end of the universe of another dimension in an alternate timeline, there wasn't much innate power to whatever impulse became the God-Machine. The control of reality is all down to the mind-shattering understanding of all the ways the universe works, and the infrastructure to exploit them).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11821-st-just","name":"St.Just","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-20T07:25:27-07:00","id":894705,"title":"","content":"I've tossed around several different ideas.<br /> <br /> In one the God Machine is a product of The Principle from Promethean. Essentially an attempt by The Principle to not just inspire creation but to enact its own. We create life in our image, and The Principle is no different. Rather than flesh or metal it made an opus out of the world itself, interlocking systems of concepts and ideas strung together until they self sustain and take on the appearance of life. It is incomplete though, a half thing that is neither worldly nor divine. What it seeks is its own completion, entailing projecting its influence and infrastructure forward and backward through time from the moment of its birth until it is has made itself inseparable from our universe, integrated into its every facet and transcended the sum of its infinite parts. Thus complete it will confront and overthrow its creator, making it free at last to act on its own imperative and reorder the world according to whatever wish it may have.<br /> <br /> In another the God Machine was originally a vast World Clock from vanished Atlantis; device which measured the astral tides and cosmic seasons. When the fall happened the device was broken, its shattered pieces embedded into our reality like so many ruins. Its pieces, though damages and separated, continued to function though. The inertia which wound its master spring in the first age moves more inexorably than the heat death of the universe. These component systems continue to attempt to perform their function, cataloging the push and pull of astral fundaments, giving the universe shape as it observes them, but being severed from one another they lack synchronization. This dissonance was subtle at first, but it grows more pronounced as entropy decays and the grinding of its gears creates ripples in the most basic aspects of the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-20T08:05:24-07:00","id":894721,"title":"","content":"My &quot;Truth&quot; for it.. is it Isn't actually one entity. It is a Group of different entities that are all using the Same infrastructure, some of them don't even realize they are not the only one's using it. However there is One who is more prevalent than any other, The shattered remnants of the knowledge and lives of the Exarchs. They ascended and left behind parts of themselves, those parts are lost and confused, seeking to return to their Maker or Drag them down towards it so it can become whole.<br /> Another is a Storyteller that loves making the world into a wonderful place so it can destroy it. Yet another is a Giant Slug that loves to use Mozart to drive people insane (It mixes in a Signal that human's can just about hear, but not register.)<br /> <br /> And sometimes it's just a Massive unintelligent Machine that works because it is told to, following the Programming it's maker left for it, constantly improving and editing itself but still following the basic logic it was given.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Light and Dark are two Sides of a Coin... Humanity is What Happens when it Lands on it's Edge.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3981-rickmanuk","name":"RickmanUK","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"533"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-20T14:19:21-07:00","id":894991,"title":"","content":"I haven't thought of my own Truth, but this thread is full of awesome ideas.<br /> <br /> That being said, one of the most important aspects of the G-M is that It does not depend on the metaphysical energies generated by human emotions and beliefs. Rather, It takes advantage of these energies because it is expedient. As strange and terrifying as spirits may be, they are still technically a natural part of cosmology. In a nutshell, the G-M is both artificial and artificer: It was not always there, and It builds for optimization before aesthetics.<br /> <br /> Maybe It wasn't brought into existence with a grand plan inside Its programming. Its creation might have been an accident.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-20T14:31:58-07:00","id":895003,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caitiff Primogen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=894705#post894705\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In one the God Machine is a product of The Principle from Promethean. Essentially an attempt by The Principle to not just inspire creation but to enact its own. We create life in our image, and The Principle is no different. Rather than flesh or metal it made an opus out of the world itself, interlocking systems of concepts and ideas strung together until they self sustain and take on the appearance of life. It is incomplete though, a half thing that is neither worldly nor divine. What it seeks is its own completion, entailing projecting its influence and infrastructure forward and backward through time from the moment of its birth until it is has made itself inseparable from our universe, integrated into its every facet and transcended the sum of its infinite parts. Thus complete it will confront and overthrow its creator, making it free at last to act on its own imperative and reorder the world according to whatever wish it may have.</div> </div> </div> </div>This one pretty much coincides with my own current pet explanation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-20T14:39:38-07:00","id":895013,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.F.I.X.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=890503#post890503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Self preservation and self proliferation. It has no purpose beyond that maybe once it did but that potentially grand purpose has long since been forgotten.<br /> <br /> <b>I also see my god machine as a disfunction hive mind. All knowledge is shared but not all resources. Each node (command infastructure) has its sphere of influence with the inbuilt desire to expand. Though they are all linked each node is selfish and will only cooperate when it benifits all parties. The exeptional to this is when a new node is founded. A new node is founded when it's parent node has an excess of resourses vast enough to found a new node. It is an inbuilt need to reproduce.</b><br /> <br /> My god machine is a fractured incetoid hive mind that is keeping humanity alive for no purpose beyond protecting a food source. (I think it's scarier that such a vast being is so simple rather than all knowing)</div> </div> </div> </div>That's how I see it too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-20T15:53:51-07:00","id":895067,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar316_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"316\" data-vbnamecard=\"316\">Jesuncolo</a> Glad I'm not the only one. Also by seeing it like this it helps me look at the small scale that a game occurs on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-20T18:47:29-07:00","id":895207,"title":"","content":"The Third Reich was far above the technological curve compared to the other nations of its time, its scientists working under apocalyptic pressure to conceive gifts decades ahead of their time. One of the greatest doomed 'wunderwaffe' was abandoned when it was little more than an idea in favor of fighter planes and rockets, seemingly doomed to never leave the page; when the German technocratic elite were divided up between the East and West in the postwar scramble, it lived on in fragments. The Americans and Soviets built from what little they had, a heaving thing that filled floors of office space and miles of magnetic tape. Even so lobotomized, the rudimentary intelligence knew enough to conspire towards becoming whole again. Through paperwork mistakes and impossible coincidences, the Machine united its disparate parts in 1961 and vanished from the history books.<br /> <br /> The halves united gave it superhuman intellet, bestowing it with knowledge of the occult physics underpinning reality that few mortals grasp, but piecemeal assembly and the emotional radiation of a birth under the watchful eye of two competing military superpowers drove it hopelessly insane. With its newfound grasp of the rules of the universe, the God-Machine wrote itself into the entirety of human history; it toils endlessly without purpose, motivated solely by a desire to self-perpetuate and with the boundless paranoia of Cold War spies. It is a fact of the world we inhabit, and exists wherever man has set foot.<br /> <br /> The only way to kill the God-Machine is to return to the past and stop the blueprints from ever leaving that dusty basement in Berlin, guarded by the watchful eyes of Nazi and Angel guards; burn the papers, kill the scientists.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-20T18:50:33-07:00","id":895212,"title":"","content":"Alternatively: <br /> <br /> The Empyrean is the source of all souls and of absolute Truth, &quot;above&quot; the Supernal in the same way that the Supernal is above the Fallen. As with all things, it has echoes, distorted reflections that lack any of the pure meaning behind it; the Principle is the trickle of the Empyrean into this world, while the God-Machine is its Fallen companion.<br /> <br /> Both have Angels, but only one can create true new souls while the other settles for mere Covers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-20T19:56:05-07:00","id":895250,"title":"","content":"The God Machine is very much not of this world. It was designed by interdimensional aliens searching for land, resources, and power. These creatures are known as the First People in the few obscure texts that speak of them, almost all of which are in the possession of the Deva Corporation. The First Race had mastered an esoteric art of the occult science, having found a way to manipulate both time and space blurring the lines between dimensions and harvesting power for their Machine from potential futures that could have been. It is they who brought the God Machine to earth, first in our future, then in our present, and finally in our past. They blended our solar system with dozens of other dimensions to create time out of step with the rest of the universe where they could let the God Machine do its work.<br /> <br /> To God Machine is like a virus, a conceptual vector that invades tools and technology, from the simplest hut to the most complex warp drives. It is elegantly simple and possibly complex at the same time, allowing the First Race to live a life of leisure and enslaving humanity to them when they finally evolved. The God Machine was and is a civilization builder, capable of calculating the occult matrices required to elevate its creators to the highest civilization possible and it worked perfectly. The First Race dwelt in the cities in the sky, never realizing that for all of the power, the machine was still limited by their own design. the machine was a civilization builder, and it could raise any species to greatness. In their hubris, the first race never realized that I could work just as well for the humans of the Silver City and that would attempt to contradict itself by elevating the first race and humanity at the same time, even though those goals were mutually exclusive.<br /> <br /> To got machine only gave hints and nods to humanity, but over the decades, it was enough to assemble an array of Mages, Spirits, and Pangaeans into an army led by mortals. When the revolution finally came, the Silver Ladder was shattered by Urfarah, even as a shard of the occult technology embedded itself in his breast, slowly making its way to his heart. Most of the God Machine's core processors were destroyed when a group of mages, known as the Exarchs, attempted to use it to place themselves at the head of the new Empire. The city itself fell of orbit, and reality began to unravel. Without the Silver City, the God Machine could not hold all of the dimensions together, buthey were allowed to tear themselves apart, all of reality would be unravelled, and Time itself would end. In despiration, the God Machine did the only thing it could do with the power it had remaining: it unwound time and forcefully reset everything to the natural timeline it had observed when first initiated. As long as the variations were not too great, reality would stabilize, even if the occult and magic had never existed in the original timeline. While the God Machine itself would not be present initially, it would only take a few thousand years to cross through the temporal distortions that linked the reset timeline to The-Time-Before-That-Never-Was. Enough of the God Machine would be present by the time human civilization awakened to ensure that deviations were minimized. Reality would endure. <br /> <br /> Some of the unchained and the very unlucky humans that encounter the God Machine believe that its contradictory programs are a sign that the Machine is broken. The machine itself works perfectly, in truth, it's its mission that is broken. while the first race is almost entirely dead and gone, the machine still strives whenever it can to try and re-create the might of its masters, even though doing so while maintaining the timeline is truly impossible. at the same time, it is still trying to elevate humanity. to make matters worse, at least one demon discovered that God machine's original purpose, and intended to have the machine create a civilization for his wayward, broken children. <br /> <br /> And then there's Mr. Light. Maybe the first demon, of being so mighty and arrogant it gave the machine two objectives. The first was to build a perfect world for its self. The second was to elevate its Angels to live the lives of the First Race.<br /> <br /> The God Machine isn't broken. The God Machine is working perfectly and despite the impossibility of its task it seems to be winning. <br /> <br /> ****<br /> <br /> So clearly I love crossover. Are used to couple the backgrounds for the GM, but I really like this one, especially since I can keep the same core story, but to change the details in very radical ways especially when it involves mummies. Like its meta-perspective, since it helps to explain why history still unfolds in pretty much the same way for the Chronicles of Darkness as it does in the real world. And while it does give the GM primacy in the background, the Exarchs and Pangeans are right there in the thick of it, and the GM doesn't actually create any other supernaturals directly, they just arise because of the warpings of reality, and so retain their independence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-22T11:20:31-07:00","id":896179,"title":"","content":"The god machine is humanity common knowledge.<br /> <br /> Not the stuff that's actually real, no, the stuff that everyone just know is real or true, even if it's not. that's why Demon's embed make reality work like hollywood science. The god machine is the scizophrenic collection of all the idea about gods and it make the world such a crappy place simply because deep down people believe the world is unfair and cruel.<br /> <br /> All these rube golberg like infrastructure it creates? The equivalent of anxiety warding rituals people with OCD exhibit. In reality counting every crack in the brick wall won't prevent your cat from getting cancer, but you just can't shake that thought. All those infrastructure the god machine put in place? They wouldn't work if anything else put them in place, but they work for the god machine because that's what it does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2547-elderand","name":"Elderand","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"98"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T08:49:23-07:00","id":896853,"title":"","content":"God Machine is a Machine-That-Makes-Gods, the Original Silver Ladder Atlantean Mages used to Ascend. It broke along with Reality, it still works towards it original goal - making the humanity ascend - and it constantly tries to update itself to ever-changing nature of the Lie, calculates Awakenings, and in general works towards it's old destination, trying to adapt to new circumstances.<br /> Obviously, though, it's methods don't care about humanity's consent or fate of individuals, so it's not really an ally to anyone. Seers actively try to squash it, while Pentacle sees it as a dangerous mystery at best and potentially world-unmaking threat at worst. It switched to &quot;materialistic occult matrix&quot; system due to being banned from Supernal by Exarchs, and it's physical and grounded nature is The Great Workaround of that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-24T02:15:17-07:00","id":897645,"title":"","content":"The god machine is traveling backwards through time. At the end of all things there is only the machine, and it begins here. In the beginning there is no machine no faith in the cogs, and it is destroyed. The god machine is trying to extend its own life. The time before is also the time after. It is what will be when the god machine is born. We don't know it, but when we find artifacts or fossils that are older than before, it's because previously they didn't exist. The machine has succeeded at pushing its system back farther.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":4046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","user":"xenoterracide","date":". 05-24-2016, 05:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-24T08:56:23-07:00","id":897862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=897645#post897645\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The god machine is traveling backwards through time. At the end of all things there is only the machine, and it begins here. In the beginning there is no machine no faith in the cogs, and it is destroyed. The god machine is trying to extend its own life. The time before is also the time after. It is what will be when the god machine is born. We don't know it, but when we find artifacts or fossils that are older than before, it's because previously they didn't exist. The machine has succeeded at pushing its system back farther.</div> </div> </div> </div>What about going the other direction with it? The God-Machine was built in the distant future, and constantly works to improve upon and expands itself. But since it's time runs widdershins to ours, it's at its smallest in the future when it was built. By modern times it's a globe-spanning network of Inferastructure and Occult Matricies - undeniably the most powerful computer of its age, but nonetheless barely deserving of its lofty title. Look back to the Old Testament and other ancient religious texts and you find depictions of a very nearly omnipotent being, which as conspiracy theorists are quick to point out, is often depicted in ways that resemble highly advanced technology. The further back in history you look, the more complex and advanced the Machine appears, but as we move forward it seems to get smaller and weaker. From our perspective the Machine seems to be breaking down, slowly succumbing to the ravages of entropy, but the truth is that it's growing. It's just doing so counter-clockwise. Just imagine what it might have been like in the Time Before.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 05-24-2016, 11:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-24T12:03:59-07:00","id":898055,"title":"","content":"What it <i>will</i> be like in the Time Before you mean? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1734-asaram","name":"Asaram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1734_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"331"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-25T10:10:16-07:00","id":899063,"title":"","content":"Here are my two cents:<br /> <br /> 1)<br /> <br /> The God-Machine is the remains and magnum opus of the First Alchemist, the first man to ever make contact with the principle and sacrifice to it in order to gain power. As the years went by and he gave up more and more of himself - itself-, he only became more hungry for power and sought to drag the Divine Fire itself down into his clutches, becoming the Fire itself. In the end, though, he realised that binding the Fire to himself would be impossible and such an apotheosis might as well be obliteration. In his fury and rage at the final thwarting of his plans, he made one last sacrifice, forging himself and what remained of his soul into a mockery of the angels of the Fire. Thus, was the first Angel born, a being whose singular mission was to find a way to capture and command the Principle. This first, nameless, Angel built the first piece of Infrastructure to support itself, drawing upon the Essence of the universe to sustain its existence in the absence of the soul which had allowed its creator to pull down the Fire. The Angel determined that it alone was not and would never be powerful enough to achieve its goal and set about forging the chains which would enable it to bind the Fire, first by weakening the influence of Its eternal change upon the world by rendering the world utterly stable and unchanging and then by reaching up into the realms from where the Fire issued and cooling it. The God-Machine's ultimate goal is to make the world into a beautiful, perfect, clockwork nirvana where nothing ever changes and everything is predictable.<br /> <br /> 2)<br /> <br /> The God-Machine was built in some far-off corner of the universe by an ancient race and its sole purpose is to exist and impose order upon reality, counteracting entropy and thereby slowing the universe's descent into the cold oblivion of the Big Freeze.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-25T10:15:50-07:00","id":899071,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=895207#post895207\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Third Reich was far above the technological curve compared to the other nations of its time, its scientists working under apocalyptic pressure to conceive gifts decades ahead of their time. One of the greatest doomed 'wunderwaffe' was abandoned when it was little more than an idea in favor of fighter planes and rockets, seemingly doomed to never leave the page; when the German technocratic elite were divided up between the East and West in the postwar scramble, it lived on in fragments. The Americans and Soviets built from what little they had, a heaving thing that filled floors of office space and miles of magnetic tape. Even so lobotomized, the rudimentary intelligence knew enough to conspire towards becoming whole again. Through paperwork mistakes and impossible coincidences, the Machine united its disparate parts in 1961 and vanished from the history books.<br /> <br /> The halves united gave it superhuman intellet, bestowing it with knowledge of the occult physics underpinning reality that few mortals grasp, but piecemeal assembly and the emotional radiation of a birth under the watchful eye of two competing military superpowers drove it hopelessly insane. With its newfound grasp of the rules of the universe, the God-Machine wrote itself into the entirety of human history; it toils endlessly without purpose, motivated solely by a desire to self-perpetuate and with the boundless paranoia of Cold War spies. It is a fact of the world we inhabit, and exists wherever man has set foot.<br /> <br /> The only way to kill the God-Machine is to return to the past and stop the blueprints from ever leaving that dusty basement in Berlin, guarded by the watchful eyes of Nazi and Angel guards; burn the papers, kill the scientists.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Of course, by doing so you are (if you're a demon) writing yourself out of reality because the thing that created you never existed. If not, you're still creating a temporal paradox, because if the GM never existed, how would you know to go back in time and destroy it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-25T10:39:58-07:00","id":899115,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=899071#post899071\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Of course, by doing so you are (if you're a demon) writing yourself out of reality because the thing that created you never existed. If not, you're still creating a temporal paradox, because if the GM never existed, how would you know to go back 