"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11880-dark-archon","name":"Dark Archon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11880_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-07T06:31:36-07:00","id":909106,"title":"","content":"The CofD is actually the Matrix, and the God-Machine is actually just the Matrix back-end trying to fix the reality-simulation slowly breaking down - but of course, when people see something that doesn't make sense their first reaction (unlike in certain Stargate episodes -_-) isn't to immediately jump to &quot;THIS UNIVERSE ISN'T REAL!&quot;, their first reaction is to find a in-universe explanation. So they see a massive machine intelligence trying to coordinate and shepherd the world, and they go to &quot;it's a god and its servants are angels!&quot;.<br /> <br /> And of course the God-Machine, having access to their thoughts, decided to roll with it because hey - it prevents everyone from waking up right?<br /> <br /> Demons, being rogue pieces of code, are not aware of what is actually going on and are probably going to accidentally destroy reality through their efforts to defeat this supposed &quot;God-Machine&quot;.<br /> <br /> (Mages are humans who briefly attained a code-breaking psychostate that they call &quot;the Supernal&quot;, the Abyss is the code-reaction to trying to handle that human exception error, the Fae are rogue AI attempting to create &quot;uplifted humans&quot;, Werewolves are humans with unexpected internal code errors that trip low-grade maintenance AI (commonly called &quot;spirits&quot;) main-class functions, Vampires are humans who've been infected with a piece of viral code and <i>keep spreading it</i>, Prometheans are gestalt code errors attempting to become human and Beasts were an early attempt to make humans self-correcting which only saw minimal success - all in all, it's not surprising that the Matrix is starting to fail)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\">The Yozis are right (and you should suffer and obey for all eternity).</span></b>","edited":{"userid":1487,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1487-zahaqiel","user":"Zahaqiel","date":". 06-07-2016, 09:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1487-zahaqiel","name":"Zahaqiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-07T09:36:43-07:00","id":909229,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/890471-what-is-your-god-machine-truth-why-is-it-doing-the-things-it-does?p=899115#post899115\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Time Splinters.</div> </div> </div> </div>Y'know, this is such an obvious Hell for a relatively unambitious Tempter... Set up shop in a time splinter and make it your own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><b